[{"type": "chat", "time": 6663.488, "timestamp": "01:51:03", "author": "@Orange-Sleipnir", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_n5J-87avtPs7B_snpcnK5WQMhN-5kM_m8EJRYz2oJ72Wg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "we gonna go for the femboy maid cafe"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6672.95, "timestamp": "01:51:12", "text": "不錯。千萬別去醫院餐廳吃飯。食物很美味。如果你不想花錢，又想嚐嚐美食，可以去像Metro這樣的超市，那裡有很多賣物美價廉美食的店家。或是去Combin超市，那裡什麼都有。我真的很想嚐嚐日本鰻魚，不過那也不錯，我喜歡鰻魚。嗯，鰻魚很"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6675.395, "timestamp": "01:51:15", "author": "@S4bOTh", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/dwyGFV5nV4j6B4rbXTQnxbALJAtFrkvLLYXpy4kpbik67Arf3Y7OK8dSERSwTEtgKPyQeDTq-w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Saiko how do you rizz japanese girls!?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6675.99, "timestamp": "01:51:15", "text": "常見，所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6677.99, "timestamp": "01:51:17", "text": "沒吃。我不是因為生病才吃的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6701.03, "timestamp": "01:51:41", "text": "我們日常飲食中本來就有很多生病的食物。對我來說，收養孩子非常容易。我覺得有些人，特別是喜歡北印度菜的人，有時也喜歡南印度菜，他們很難接受新食物，但當你注意到人們很快就能適應新食物時，你會發現我們適應得非常快。這可能與我們的飲食習慣有關。嗯。但是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6703.03, "timestamp": "01:51:43", "text": "我們目前面臨的唯一問題是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6705.189, "timestamp": "01:51:45", "text": "食物不夠辣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6707.109, "timestamp": "01:51:47", "text": "即使你要求最辣的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6710.47, "timestamp": "01:51:50", "text": "最辣的，它也不辣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6713.51, "timestamp": "01:51:53", "text": "我們想去吃家庭男孩瑪薩拉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6715.27, "timestamp": "01:51:55", "text": "我非常喜歡清澈的酒。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6717.189, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "text": "喜歡像調和威士忌那樣年份久遠的酒。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6717.304, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "where is that place which has soo many red gates and there's something written on them, some temple i suppose?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6719.189, "timestamp": "01:51:59", "text": "威士忌不錯。"}]